hub.com/AThousandShips)\n\nI was running it from an Android device, not iPhone.\n\nWhat do you mean by redeploy? In my case I was pressing the \"remote deploy\" button in the editor. I dont know if its triggering a full redeploy of the app (with the updated .po files) hence my issue.\n\nMaybe it's been fixed by another fix in Godot 4.4?\nI'll check again.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816283158/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2816302501","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99566#issuecomment-2816302501","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99566","id":2816302501,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n3V2l","user":{"login":"Nallebeorn","id":7013489,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMTM0ODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7013489?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn","html_url":"https://github.com/Nallebeorn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-18T22:36:04Z","updated_at":"2025-04-18T22:36:16Z","body":"> What do you mea